    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107229" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεράλλομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spring</i> or <i>leap over,</i> or <i>beyond,</i>
			c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλῆς ὑπεράλμενον</span>
				(aor. 2
			part.) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.138
			</span></i>: also c. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὰς στίχας
				ὑπερᾶλτο</span> (aor. 2) <i><span class="en">
				20.327
			</span></i>; so in Prose, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.4.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eq.</u>
				8.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. πλοίων ἱστούς,</span> of
			dolphins, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				631a22
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς μαχαίρας,</span> of
			sword-dancers, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.74S.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν σκιὰν τὴν ἑαυτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.1071b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
